WEBVTT

00:00:57.512 --> 00:01:00.848
Those melismatic runs
are really difficult to hit.

00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:05.603
To show you Holly+'s full range,
I'll also play an example in German.

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:07.855
This is "Mack the Knife" by Brecht.

00:01:08.481 --> 00:01:11.943
(Singing in German)

00:01:21.828 --> 00:01:23.371
(Music ends)

00:01:24.997 --> 00:01:26.999
Of course Holly+ can -- thank you.

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.627
(Applause)

00:01:29.669 --> 00:01:32.380
Of course, Holly+ can also
perform my own music,